# Simfinity Project

## Overview

Next.js 15 frontend for Simfinity. Dynamic, schema-driven form and table management built with `@simtlix/simfinity-fe-components`, Material-UI v7, and TypeScript 5.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router, TypeScript 5 strict mode
- **UI**: Material-UI v7.3.1 (MUI), MUI X Data Grid 8.10.0, Tailwind CSS 4 + Emotion
- **Data Layer**: `@simtlix/simfinity-fe-components` 1.0.20, `@simtlix/simfinity-js-client` 1.0.2
- **Component Dev**: Storybook 10 (`@storybook/nextjs-vite`)
- **Testing**: Vitest 4, Playwright 1.58
- **i18n**: Dual system (JSON-based + function-based)

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/                              # Next.js App Router
│   ├── entities/[listField]/         # Dynamic entity routes (list, create, edit, view)
│   ├── layout.tsx                    # Root layout (Server Component)
│   ├── page.tsx                      # Home page
│   └── providers.tsx                 # Provider hierarchy + setupSimfinity()
├── components/
│   ├── app/                          # App shell (AppHeader, LayoutShell, Sidebar, SimfinityFallbacks, ThemeToggle)
│   └── custom/                       # Reusable custom components with Storybook stories
│       ├── index.ts                  # Barrel export (components + types)
│       ├── <Component>.tsx           # Component with exported props interface
│       └── <Component>.stories.tsx   # Storybook story
├── simfinitySetup/                   # All Simfinity registrations
│   ├── index.ts                      # Entry point: setupSimfinity()
│   ├── i18n/                         # Function-based label registration
│   ├── <entity>/                     # Per-entity customizations
│   │   ├── index.ts                  # Wires all entity registrations
│   │   ├── <entity>.create.ts(x)     # registerFormCustomization for create mode
│   │   ├── <entity>.edit.ts(x)       # registerFormCustomization for edit mode
│   │   ├── <entity>.view.tsx         # registerFormCustomization for view mode
│   │   ├── <entity>.column.<field>.tsx  # registerColumnRenderer per field
│   │   └── <entity>.stateMachine.ts  # registerEntityStateMachine
├── i18n/                             # Function-based i18n (en.ts, es.ts)
├── lib/
│   ├── simfinityClientRef.ts         # Shared client ref for non-React usage
│   └── themeContext.tsx              # MUI theme system
└── public/i18n/                      # Static JSON labels (en.json, es.json)
```

## Provider Hierarchy

`setupSimfinity()` runs once at module scope in `providers.tsx`, then:

`InitGuard` → `SimfinityClientProvider` → `ClientRefCapture` → `I18nProvider` → `ThemeProvider` → `MuiThemeProvider` + `CssBaseline` → children

## Core APIs (from @simtlix/simfinity-fe-components)

### Registration Functions

| Function | Purpose | Example File |
|---|---|---|
| `registerFormCustomization(entity, mode, config)` | Form layout, fields, callbacks | `serie/serie.create.tsx` |
| `registerColumnRenderer(key, renderer)` | Custom table column display | `episode/episode.column.date.tsx` |
| `registerEntityStateMachine(entity, config)` | State transitions + mutations | `season/season.stateMachine.ts` |
| `registerFunctionLabels(locale, labels)` | Dynamic i18n labels | `i18n/i18n.setup.ts` |

### Components

| Component | Usage |
|---|---|
| `EntityForm` | Schema-driven forms (create/edit/view) |
| `EntityTable` | Data grid with sorting/filtering/pagination |
| `SimfinityClientProvider` | Wraps app with data client |
| `I18nProvider` | Wraps app with i18n context |

### Hooks

| Hook | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `useSimfinityClient()` | Access Simfinity client |
| `useI18n()` | Access locale, setLocale, resolveLabel |
